      "side": 1,
      "message": "I noticed that in order to run the gitiles tests I have to cd to modules/jgit, similar like for jgit tests. We should ensure that both jgit submodule links \n- module/jgit\n- module/gitiles/modules/jgit\nlink to the same commit. The first one is used to build gerrit including gitiles, the latter is used for running gitiles tests.\n\nHence maybe add a build time test raising a warning if these submodule links to jgit link to different versions of jgit.",
      "revId": "bb29c8aa70519c40d0b05eb31a52876d801a41cc",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
